            title: 'Pedro Sancho',
            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Pedro variant (also called Nine-Five) for four to seven players. Six cards each; one round of bidding (0–18). High bidder names trumps; the 5 (pedro) and 9 (sancho) of that suit score 5 and 9 points. First to 100 wins. Bidder must lead trump; follow suit when trump is led.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Pedro variant from the USA; a trick-taking game with 5 and 9 as permanent trumps.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
